  <data name="UIModel_PowerShellModulesLogging_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pipeline execution events for members of the specified modules are recorded in Windows PowerShell log in the Event Viewer. For built-in Windows PowerShell 5.1 only.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="UIModel_PowerShellScriptsLogging_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Windows PowerShell will log processing of commands, script blocks, functions, and scripts – whether invoked interactively, or through automation to "Applications and Services Logs\Microsoft\Windows\PowerShell\Operational" event log. For the built-in Windows PowerShell 5.1 only.</value>
