  <data name="UIModel_InstallDotNetRuntime_8_Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>.NET is a successor to .NET Framework. You need to install .NET 8 if an app was developed within this framework, even if you already installed any other .NET versions. .NET 8 is an LTS (long-term support) version. The installer will be downloaded from the Microsoft resource (Internet connection required).</value>
